From 2b8bb90d45c36b0156e8049852fa0c5a58fea67a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sardi-dev <134648583+sardi-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:39:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/25] Let spells see through small doodads

Spell line of sight checks stopped at every M2 model in the map files,
such as barrels, kegs, lamps and other decorations, so spells failed
with "out of line of sight" where the target was in plain view. Spell
casts, target checks and chain targets now ignore M2 models, which
the extracted vmaps already mark; buildings and game objects still
block. Other line of sight checks keep their behaviour.

Ported from TrinityCore 3.3.5.
